{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Rolling Toss&quot; is a simple run puzzle game where you successfully clear rolling blocks with a set number of clicks. Various gimmicks appear on each stage! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim to clear the stage by making full use of the gimmicks and block divisions within the stage! Can you use your brain to clear the 50 stages + 5 EXTRA stages? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25bcPart of the stage gimmick revealed! !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbFloor that changes the direction of block movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbWall to delete blocks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also stages that can be cleared with fewer clicks than the predetermined number of clicks! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim to clear with the minimum number of clicks!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3362830/897ae234719bbfa3d556ff5d81b100e75ac07598.jpg"},{"name":"Getting the Hang of It?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3362830/3b40fe1d894ef66c687f263230426d26e61f61ca.jpg"},{"name":"Rookie No More","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3362830/df4eef8edda77fc491552617f6f4e0d67ae9b6b3.jpg"},{"name":"More and More to Come","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3362830/1927fcb875297427f8aea8482ae3d6afa98ce877.jpg"},{"name":"Beyond Annihilation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3362830/38ec7b633f980c34d5890be0d1fa8c817650dc4c.jpg"},{"name":"You're an Advanced Player Now!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3362830/fcb000b02ec54bd7315d1eb75fd84ea80341430a.jpg"},{"name":"Amazing! You're the Master!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunit